      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halfway%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A post office has operated continuously in Halfway since 1850, making it one of Missouri’s oldest postal communities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halfway%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Halfway is officially part of the Springfield, Missouri Metropolitan Statistical Area, linking it to the region’s economic hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
