        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halfway%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The village lies within Polk County, placing it in the heart of southwestern Missouri’s rural landscape.",
